    <div>&nbsp;</div>
    <div class="component comp-footnotes" data-component="Footnotes">

                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote1" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 1"><sup>1</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>For more on the Fed’s history, see  Jeffrey M. Lacker, "<a href="/press_room/speeches/jeffrey_m_lacker/2013/lacker_speech_20130829">A Look Back at the History of the Federal Reserve</a>," Speech at Christopher Newport University, Newport News, VA, August 29, 2013; and "<a href="/press_room/speeches/jeffrey_m_lacker/2013/lacker_speech_20131101">Global Interdependence and Central Banking</a>," Speech at the Global Interdependence Center, The Union League of Philadelphia, Philadelphia, PA, November 1, 2013.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote2" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 2"><sup>2</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>The latest Blue Chip compilation of economists’ projections, for example, calls for 2.8 percent growth in real GDP next year.</p></div>
                </div>
                <div class="comp-footnotes__note">
                    <a href="javascript:;" id="footnote3" class="comp-footnotes__note-num" aria-label="Go to inline footnote 3"><sup>3</sup></a>
                    <div class="comp-footnotes__content"><p>I would like to thank Roy Webb for assistance in preparing these remarks.</p></div>
                </div>
    </div>
